### Generar la llave -> size=8, 4 matches en ronda 1 (3 bye + 1 pendiente)
# @name generateBracket
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}/bracket

### Ver la llave generada
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}/bracket

### Generarla de nuevo -> 409 (ya existe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}/bracket

### Categoria sin llave todavia -> 404
# @name createEmptyCategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tournament_id": {{createTournament.response.body.$.id}},
  "gender": "female",
  "age_label": "Cadete",
  "min_age": 12,
  "max_age": 14,
  "belt_group": "color",
  "weight_label": "Hasta 45kg"
}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{createEmptyCategory.response.body.$.id}}/bracket

### Menos de 2 inscritos -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{createEmptyCategory.response.body.$.id}}/bracket
